KW  - generalized affiliation indices
KW  - social structure
KW  - Sousa sahulensis
KW  - BOTTLE-NOSED DOLPHINS
KW  - PEARL RIVER ESTUARY
KW  - SOCIAL-STRUCTURE
KW  - ASSOCIATION PATTERNS
KW  - SEXUAL SEGREGATION
